on><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.</span></span></strong><span><span>普通高校相关专业2027年能够按期毕业且有望获得推免资格的应届本科毕业生；报考口腔医学专业学位硕士，须为全日制口腔医学专业；</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.</span></span></strong><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，积极向上，愿为国家和军队医疗卫生事业服务；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.</span></span></strong><span>身体健康，符合《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》的要求，且能胜任正常学习工作任务，其中传染病相关项目须符合军队相关规定；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>4.</span></span></strong><span>大学本科成绩优秀，达到所在院校推免要求；原则上要求截止目前本科期间成绩达到本专业年级排名前10%（双一流建设高校可放宽至前30%）；</span></p><p><span><strong><span>5.</span></strong></span><span>CET-6≥450分；</span></p><p><span><strong><span>6.</span></strong></span><span>无任何违法违纪及受处分记录。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/Ir26pkwHyACeOK6YEtWPpbUjibopmnR7j2UjFibdxpsUDH7b0UtqSF3p5Y2mDyDmMlUdsyca5mLHAPFrBLia8bYgrWV31PRSg1qIWDs52dhFFU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>1.学生申请：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>申请材料提交截止时间为7月22日16:00前；</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>2.材料审核：</span></strong></span><span>考核组将于7月24日18:00前统一对信息进行审核、筛选，并向学生反馈审核